@startuml
actor Student
participant "Student screen" as Screen
participant "ApiClient / session" as Client
participant "Student controller" as Controller
participant "MediatR handler" as Handler
database "TutoringDbContext" as Database
Student -> Screen: Open overview, agreement, lesson or charges
Screen -> Client: GET /api/students/me/...
Client -> Controller: Bearer access token
Controller -> Controller: Require Student role and valid sub
Controller -> Handler: Send query with authenticated AccountId
Handler -> Database: No-tracking query scoped to Student.UserAccountId
alt Owned resource
Database --> Handler: Student-visible fields only
Handler --> Controller: Response DTO
Controller --> Screen: 200 response
else Missing or foreign resource
Handler --> Controller: Existing NotFound exception
Controller --> Screen: 404 ProblemDetails
end
Screen --> Student: Data, empty state or error with retry
@enduml
